@startuml kairos-event-registration-paid-checkout-sequence
title Event Registration and Checkout (Paid Event)

actor Member
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB
participant "Payment Gateway" as Pay

Member -> MemberApp: Click "Register" on Event
MemberApp -> API: POST /events/{eventId}/registrations
API -> DB: INSERT EventRegistration (status="PendingPayment")
DB --> API: registrationId
API --> MemberApp: 201 Created {registrationId}

Member -> MemberApp: See checkout page\nEnter payment details
MemberApp -> Pay: Create payment session
Pay --> MemberApp: Payment form
Member -> Pay: Submit payment
Pay --> MemberApp: Payment success callback
MemberApp -> API: POST /events/{eventId}/payments/confirm {registrationId, gatewayRef}
API -> DB: UPDATE EventRegistration (status="Registered")
DB --> API: OK
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK

MemberApp --> Member: Show registration success + QR code

@enduml
